    <text class="refund-age-diagram__detail" x="72" y="342"
      >只有完整查詢成功，才更新成功快照時間。</text
    >
    <rect
      class="refund-age-diagram__card"
      x="48"
      y="382"
      width="864"
      height="112"
      rx="12"></rect>
    <text class="refund-age-diagram__label" x="72" y="416"
      >3 · 兩個問題分開告警</text
